  "preamble": "Depalatalization of the alveolo-palatal fricative [ɕ] to the palato-alveolar [ʃ]. In Lithuanian the Proto-Balto-Slavic satem sibilant *ś, from PIE *ḱ, merged with *š, so *śimta- 'hundred' gives šimtas and *déśimt 'ten' gives dešimt; Slavic merged the same *ś with s instead.",
